TFC Horizon — Horizon-native workshop mod (TerraFirmaCraft-inspired survival).

Inspired by TerraFirmaCraft (TFC) for Minecraft Java 1.20.1 as used in
TerraFirmaGreg-Modern packs. Not affiliated with TFC / Dries007 / AlcatrazEscapee
or TFG authors. Clean reimplementation for Horizon — not a jar port.

Reference (read-only design): TerraFirmaCraft 1.20.1 open-source mechanics.
Plan: docs/tfc-plan.md
Tracker: mods/tfc/tracker/catalog.json

Original Rust and JSON in this folder: MIT unless noted otherwise.
Minecraft / Mojang assets are not redistributed. Placeholder textures are
solid-color PNGs generated for workshop smoke; replace before public release.
